  c3a-N-def      PASS c3a-N-def N(k,q) by DFS over surjective legal words (k<=9) == binomial inversion of the DP table; N(k,q)=0 for q>k (k<=30)
  c4-N-dfs       PASS c4-N-dfs N(k,q) == 按定义 DFS 枚举合法满射词（core.N_brute），k<=8
