== #11 what C3B-RES / C3B-PX / C3B-INT check; C3B-INT cited?
  C3B-PX   C3B-PX b_v-b_m=(m-v)x^3; P_{j-1} == (m)_j x^{3j} and W_m == 1+sum_j j(m)_j x^{3j+2} (positive coeffs) mod b_m, so W_m(x_m)>=1; 1<=j<=m<=30
  C3B-INT  C3B-INT rational interval arithmetic: W_m(x_m)>0 and G_{m-1}(x_m)+m x_m^2>0 at x_m=1/rho_m, 1<=m<=30
  C3B-RES  C3B-RES Res_z G_m = Res_z G_v * (-1)^{m-v}/((m-v)! z^{3(m-v)}) at every root z of b_v (exact, mod b_v), 0<=v<m<=12
  C3B-INT cited in report: False
